\"97925\" ><h3 class=\"OMP_inlineBlock\">One Battle After Another</h3></a>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_ratingRunningSection OMP_margin10-t\">\r\n <img title=\"IFCO - 15A\" class=\"OMP_elementsIE\" src=\"/images/ratings/IE_15A.png\" />\r\n <img title=\"BBFC - 15\" class=\"OMP_elementsUK\" src=\"/images/ratings/UK_15.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"OMP_padding10-l\">\r\n<p><strong>Running Time</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"OMP_colourD\"> 2hrs 41min</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_ratingRunningSection OMP_margin10-t\">\r\n<p><strong>&pound;1.00 cheaper online</strong></p></div>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_descriptionSection OMP_margin20-t OMP_hide-md\" id=\"description97925\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<h6>Description</h6>\r\n<p class=\"OMP_colourD\">From Warner Bros. Pictures and Academy Award-nominated, BAFTA-winning filmmaker Paul Thomas Anderson comes One Battle After Another, starring Academy Award and BAFTA-winner Leonardo DiCaprio</p><br />\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_fullWidthSection\">\r\n<div id=\"list97925\" class=\"OMP_listingSection OMP_padding20-tb\"><div data-date=\"12-11-2025\" class=\"OMP_listingDate OMP_padding5-tb\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<p><strong>Tomorrow</strong>&nbsp;<span class=\"OMP_colourD\">12th November 2025</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_perfList OMP_listRecline\">\r\n<div class=\"OMP_perfTimes OMP_selectionListV2\">\r\n<span data-attr=\"\" class=\"perfGridListV2\">\r\n<a class=\"OMP_buttonSelection OMP_split50 OMP_split100-md\" data-at=\" (2D | Seniors Club)\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/sutton/seats/32630\">\r\n<span>\r\n<div class=\"flexJustifyV2 top\"><h3 class=\"time\">12:00 <soan class=\"endtime\"> - 14:41</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"price OMP_inlineBlock\">\r\n<p class=\"OMP_inlineBlock fromText\">From</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"OMP_inlineBlock minPrice\">&pound;3.95</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><div class=\"flexJustifyV2 middleSection\"><div class=\"time\">\r\n<p class=\"omp_accessText\">&nbsp;</p>