ouse in and around Montana, we see her acting increasingly agitated and erratic, leaving her companion, Jackson, increasingly worried and helpless.</p><br />\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_fullWidthSection\">\r\n<div id=\"list470847\" class=\"OMP_listingSection OMP_padding20-tb\"><div data-date=\"11-11-2025\" class=\"OMP_listingDate OMP_padding5-tb open\">\r\n<p><strong>Today</strong>&nbsp;<span class=\"OMP_colourD\">11th November 2025</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_perfList OMP_listRecline\">\r\n<div class=\"OMP_perfTimes OMP_selectionListV2\">\r\n<span data-attr=\"\" class=\"perfGridListV2\">\r\n<a class=\"OMP_buttonSelection OMP_split50 OMP_split100-md\" data-at=\" (2D | 2D)\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/sutton/seats/33103\">\r\n<span>\r\n<div class=\"flexJustifyV2 top\"><h3 class=\"time\">14:20 <soan class=\"endtime\"> - 16:18</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"price OMP_inlineBlock\">\r\n<p class=\"OMP_inlineBlock fromText\">From</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"OMP_inlineBlock minPrice\">&pound;6.95</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><div class=\"flexJustifyV2 middleSection\"><div class=\"time\">\r\n<p class=\"omp_accessText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div><div class=\"flexJustifyV2 bottom\"><div class=\"hall\">Screen 4</div>\r\n<div class=\"price type flexJustifyV2\">\r\n<p class=\"OMP_padding5-r omp_typeText \">&nbsp;</p></div>\r\n</div></span>\r\n</a>\r\n<a class=\"OMP_buttonSelection OMP_split50 OMP_split100-md\" data-at=\" (2D | 2D)\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/sutton/seats/33102\">\r\n<span>\r\n<div class=\"flexJustifyV2 top\"><h3 class=\"time\">17:00 <soan class=\"endtime\"> - 18:58</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"price OMP_inlineBlock\">\r\n<p class=\"OMP_inlineBlock fromText\">From</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"OMP_inlineBlock minPrice\">&pound;6.95</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><div class=\"flexJustifyV2 middleSection\"><div class=\"time\">\r\n<p class=\"omp_accessText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div