ss=\"OMP_fullWidthSection\">\r\n<div id=\"list103672\" class=\"OMP_listingSection OMP_padding20-tb\"><div data-date=\"20-11-2025\" class=\"OMP_listingDate OMP_padding5-tb\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<p><strong>Thursday</strong>&nbsp;<span class=\"OMP_colourD\">20th November 2025</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_perfList OMP_listRecline\">\r\n<div class=\"OMP_perfTimes OMP_selectionListV2\">\r\n<span data-attr=\"\" class=\"perfGridListV2\">\r\n<a class=\"OMP_buttonSelection OMP_split50 OMP_split100-md\" data-at=\" (EVENT-STANDARD | 2D)\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/sutton/seats/32323\">\r\n<span>\r\n<div class=\"flexJustifyV2 top\"><h3 class=\"time\">17:30 <soan class=\"endtime\"> - 22:28</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"price OMP_inlineBlock\">\r\n<p class=\"OMP_inlineBlock fromText\">From</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"OMP_inlineBlock minPrice\">&pound;11.95</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><div class=\"flexJustifyV2 middleSection\"><div class=\"time\">\r\n<p class=\"omp_accessText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div><div class=\"flexJustifyV2 bottom\"><div class=\"hall\">Screen 3</div>\r\n<div class=\"price type flexJustifyV2\">\r\n<p class=\"OMP_padding5-r omp_typeText \">&nbsp;</p><img class=\"OMP_perfTypeImage OMP_perfTypeImageV2\" title=\"OmniplexRecline\" src=\"/images/perf_attributes/new/maxx.svg\">\r\n</div>\r\n</div></span>\r\n</a>\r\n</span>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div></div></div>  <div class=\"OMP_locationMap\">\r\n    <div class=\"OMP_bodyColumnFull\"><div class=\"OMP_splitContainer OMP_bgB1\"><div class=\"OMP_splitSection OMP_split40 OMP_split100-md\"><div class=\"OMP_cinemaImageContainer\"><img class=\"OMP_cinemaImage OMP_vAlignMiddle OMP_hide-md\" width=\"761\" height=\"542\" src=\"/cms/Sutton 761x542 002.png\"/><img class=\"OMP_cinemaImage OMP_vAlignMiddle OMP_hide OMP_inlineBlock-md\" width=\"421\" height=\"518\" src=\"/cms/Sutton 430X274.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"OMP_splitSection OMP_split60 OMP_split100-md\"><div class=\"OMP_contactInfo OMP_padding30-tb OMP_padding10-t-md OMP_padding10-b-md OMP_margin40-t OMP_margin20-t-md\"><h3> Sutton Surrey Listings & Tickets</h3><p class=\"OMP_hide-xmd\">Omniplex Cinema Sutton is a 12-screen cinema in Sutton, surrounded by a great selection of local restaurants, shops and facilities. Check out all of the latest movies and classic re-releases in this modern multiplex. It is the perfect place for lovers of the big screen. \r\n\r\nWhat to expect at Omniplex Cinema Sutton:\r\n\r\nAt Omniplex Cinema Sutton, watch your new favourite movies on our cutting-edge OmniplexMAXX screen. This cinema also features Recline seats, Sofa seats 3D performances, assigned seating and wheelchair-accessibility. Before heading into the screen, stock up on fresh popcorn made on-site, as well as nachos,hotdogs, sweets and soft drinks. We offer free parking for up to 3 hours! Simply ask our cinema staff to stamp your parking ticket.</p><div class=\"mainInfo OMP_splitContainer OMP_padding30-t OMP_padding10-t-md OMP_margin20-t OMP_margin10-t-md OMP_borderTopD OMP_borderNone-md\"><div class=\"OMP_splitSection OMP_split50 OMP_split100-md\"><div class=\"infoIcon infoText\"><p>St. Nicholas Shopping Centre,</p><p>Sutton SM1 1AZ</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=-0.1956,51.3612&query_place_id=ChIJCVoy8QwIdkgRSl5IuVrf_OE\" target=\"_blank\">Get Directions</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>  </div>\r\n<div class=\"OMP_homeAds OMP_padding30-tb OMP_padding10-tb-md\">\r\n<div class=\"OMP_bodyColumnFeature\">\r\n<div class=\"OMP_homeAdsContainer OMP_padding20-t OMP_padding5-tb-md\">\r\n<div class=\"OMP_homeAd OMP_margin20-tb \"><div class=\"OMP_adContent OMP_block OMP_hide-md\"><h3>MyOmniPass</h3><p>Get a ticket to every movie for a monthly subscription!</p><a class=\"OMP_button OMP_buttonWhite\" href=\"/join\">Join Now</a></div><div class=\"OMP_adContent OMP_hide OMP_block-md\"><a href=\"/join